# SOUNDINGS: a creature beaten (or fled from) is gone from the map for the
# rest of the dive, however long and wherever the divers swim; every
# creature is back after surfacing.
game soundings
wait 30
press A
wait 20
cheat equip 0 0 1
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press A
wait 5
cheat onlymob 42 8
cheat at 40 8
waituntil scene == 6 200
cheat foehp 0 1
cheat bot 0
botuntil scene == 4 3000
cheat bot_off
expect mobstate0 == 2
wait 2000
cheat at 20 12
wait 3000
expect mobstate0 == 2
cheat at 48 5
hold UP 40
expect scene == 8
wait 30
press A
wait 10
expect scene == 1
press A
wait 5
expect scene == 4
expect mobstate0 == 0
